@@ -0,0 +1,420 @@
+// Copyright 2026 The Stedding Authors
+// Use of this source code is governed by a BSD-style license that can be
+// found in the LICENSE file.
+
+// docs/features/menus.md M8, M9 (PLAN.md TAB-18, CMD-2). The tab menu's
+// Stedding verbs through TabStripModel's context-menu API -- the path the
+// horizontal tab strip's controller takes -- and through a TabMenuModel whose
+// delegate answers from the model the way that controller does. Until the
+// helper, the model answered false for the two submenu rows, so neither
+// submenu opened, and an entry between First and Last reached NOTREACHED.
